---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro'

const title = "How to read the Base44 changelog when your app feels stuck"
const description = "Use the official Base44 product changelog and RSS; never invent titles. Pair with status."
const datePublished = "2026-09-04"
const url = 'https://base44expert.com/blog/base44-changelog-what-changed'

const jsonLd = [
  {
    '@context': 'https://schema.org',
    '@type': 'BlogPosting',
    headline: title,
    description,
    datePublished,
    author: { '@type': 'Organization', name: 'Base44 Expert' },
    publisher: { '@type': 'Organization', name: 'Base44 Expert', url: 'https://base44expert.com' },
    mainEntityOfPage: url,
    url,
  },
  {
    '@context': 'https://schema.org',
    '@type': 'BreadcrumbList',
    itemListElement: [
      { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 1, name: 'Home', item: 'https://base44expert.com/' },
      { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 2, name: 'Blog', item: 'https://base44expert.com/blog' },
      { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 3, name: title, item: url },
    ],
  },
]
---

<Layout title={`${title} — Base44 Expert`} description={description} jsonLd={jsonLd}>
  <main id="main">
    <article class="section-padding">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <p class="label-eyebrow mb-2">
          <a href="/blog" class="underline underline-offset-2">Blog</a>
          <span aria-hidden="true"> · </span>
          <time datetime={datePublished}>{datePublished}</time>
        </p>
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl text-ink mb-8 text-balance">{title}</h1>
        <div class="prose-studio text-stone leading-relaxed space-y-4">
          <p>When your app feels stuck after a platform change, read the official product changelog — do not invent what “must have shipped.”</p>
          <p>Canonical sources: <a href="https://docs.base44.com/changelog/product" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">docs.base44.com/changelog/product</a> and its <a href="https://docs.base44.com/changelog/product/rss.xml" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">RSS feed</a>. Pair that with <a href="https://status.base44.com" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">status.base44.com</a>.</p>
          <p>This studio mirrors titles at build time on <a href="/updates">/updates</a> and the homepage. If RSS cannot be fetched, we show an honest link — never fake headlines.</p>
          <p>Changelog literacy is part of triage: know what Base44 changed before you assume your schema is haunted.</p>

        </div>
        <p class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-line">
          <a href="/start" class="btn-primary">Start a diagnostic</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>
